# LAB 10

# Securing the GitOps Application

## Objective

In this lab, students will secure the NGINX application that was previously deployed using GitOps.

The application will be enhanced with:

* Dedicated Service Account
* RBAC
* Network Policies
* Pod Security Standards
* CIS Benchmark Validation

All changes will be applied through GitHub and synchronized by ArgoCD.

---

