# Step 5 – Create RBAC Role

Create

role.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1

kind: Role

metadata:
  name: nginx-reader
  namespace: production

rules:

- apiGroups: [""]

  resources:
  - pods
  - services

  verbs:
  - get
  - list
  - watch
```

Explanation

The Service Account can

✔ View Pods

✔ View Services

Cannot

✖ Delete Pods

✖ Create Pods

✖ Modify Deployments

---

# Step 6 – Create RoleBinding

rolebinding.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1

kind: RoleBinding

metadata:
  name: nginx-binding
  namespace: production

subjects:

- kind: ServiceAccount
  name: nginx-sa
  namespace: production

roleRef:

  kind: Role
  name: nginx-reader
  apiGroup: rbac.authorization.k8s.io
```

