# Step 13 – Implement Default Deny Network Policy

Create

networkpolicy.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy

metadata:
  name: default-deny
  namespace: production

spec:
  podSelector: {}

  policyTypes:
  - Ingress
  - Egress
```

Update `kustomization.yaml` or Helm templates to include this manifest, then commit and push.

