# Step 15 – Allow Required Traffic

Create

allow-ingress.yaml

```yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: NetworkPolicy

metadata:
  name: allow-nginx

spec:

  podSelector:

    matchLabels:

      app: nginx

  ingress:

  - {}

  policyTypes:

  - Ingress
```

Commit

Push

ArgoCD synchronizes automatically.

