# Step 16 – Enable Pod Security Standards

Label namespace

```bash
kubectl label namespace production \
pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce=restricted \
--overwrite
```

Verify

```bash
kubectl get ns production --show-labels
```

---

# Step 17 – Test Pod Security

Deploy an intentionally insecure Pod.

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: privileged-test
  namespace: production
spec:
  containers:
  - name: test
    image: busybox
    command: ["sleep","3600"]
    securityContext:
      privileged: true
```

Apply

```bash
kubectl apply -f privileged-test.yaml
```

Expected

```
Error from server

violates PodSecurity "restricted"
```

Explain why the Pod was rejected.

