# Step 19 – Validate GitOps Drift Protection

Attempt a manual change.

```bash
kubectl scale deployment nginx-demo \
-n production \
--replicas=5
```

Observe ArgoCD.

```bash
kubectl get applications -n argocd
```

Within the configured sync interval (or after a manual sync), ArgoCD should restore the replica count defined in Git.

